      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schaefferstown%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Historic Schaefferstown hosts an annual Cherry Fair and Early American Craft Show each June, drawing visitors to local artisans.",
